        "Description": "Viana Buccho has contracted the ICA to eliminate four laboratory technicians and the head project supervisor at a top secret Ether Corporation facility. She holds them personally responsible for the death of one of her closest friends and colleagues, due to gross and intentional negligence. Due to the sensitive nature of the project, Ether admits no wrong doing and refuses to compensate the family of the deceased. Buccho wants us to send Corporate a message, loud and clear. (No Loudouts Allowed)",
